From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:21:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 209/342] usb_webcam: applications can ask for the frame sizes

A VIDEO_FRAME_SIZES_REQUEST to the producer's port is answered with each
size the camera streams, its frame rate and whether it comes compressed,
as AcceptVideoFrame() would choose the mode, from the smallest. Unlike a
format proposal it changes nothing, also while streaming. For NeoCam.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
